※ pl4g-test: compile=fail
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4428 LANG_IF_NEEDS_AN_ELSE

※ Where a value is wanted, every way through has to produce one -- and an `if`
※ with no `else` has a way through that runs none of its arms.

let n: mut u8 = 3u8

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    let kept: u8 = if n = 3u8:
        1u6
    kept
